    "在所选日期的详情中点击收藏。收藏按图片记录，同一图片出现在多个日期或地区时不会重复计数。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the details for the selected date, click Favorite. Favorites are tracked per image, so the same image appearing on multiple dates or regions is counted only once."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択した日付の詳細でお気に入りをクリックします。お気に入りは画像ごとに記録され、同じ画像が複数の日付や地域に表示されても重複してカウントされません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在月度、年度与收藏之间切换": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch between monthly, yearly, and favorites."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "月間、年間、お気に入りを切り替えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在每日内容或回顾中点击星标即可收藏。收藏图片会保护其缓存，不会被自动清理删除。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click the star in daily content or Recap to favorite. Favorited images protect their cache and won't be removed by automatic cleanup."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "毎日のコンテンツまたは振り返りで星をクリックするとお気に入りにできます。お気に入りの画像はキャッシュが保護され、自動クリーンアップで削除されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在照片图库与整月日历之间切换": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch between photo library and full-month calendar"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写真ライブラリと1か月表示のカレンダーを切り替えます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "地区": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
