    },
    "其余 %lld 天没有本机记录": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The other %lld days have no local record"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "残り %lld 日はこの Mac に記録がありません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "该范围与本机可统计的区间（首次记录 %@ 至统计截止 %@）没有重叠，因此没有可统计的日期。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This range does not overlap the period this Mac can count (first record %@ to cutoff %@), so there are no days to compare against."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この範囲は、この Mac で集計できる期間（最初の記録 %@ から集計締切 %@）と重ならないため、集計できる日がありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "该范围没有可统计的日期。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There are no countable days in this range."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この範囲に集計できる日はありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还不知道本机从哪天开始有记录，因此没有总天数可对照。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first local record date is unknown, so there is no total to compare against."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この Mac で記録が始まった日が不明なため、比較できる合計日数がありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "统计范围内没有记录到任何地区。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No regions were recorded in this range."
          }
