    },
    "覆盖率 = 有记录的天数 ÷ 统计范围内的天数，只反映本机保存了多少天。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coverage = days with records ÷ days in the range. It reflects only how many days this Mac saved."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "カバレッジ = 記録のある日数 ÷ 集計範囲の日数。この Mac が何日分保存したかだけを表します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有记录的日期可能是应用未运行、内容未获取或请求失败，不代表 Bing 当天没有发布图片。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A date without a record may mean the app was not running, content was not fetched, or a request failed. It does not mean Bing published no image that day."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "記録のない日付は、アプリが起動していなかった、内容を取得していない、または通信に失敗した可能性があります。Bing がその日に画像を公開しなかったという意味ではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有记录的日期": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dates with records"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "記録のある日付"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只列出本机有记录的日期；没有记录的日期不会列出，也不会补成 0 张图片。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only dates with local records are listed. Dates without records are omitted, not filled with 0 images."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この Mac に記録がある日付だけを表示します。記録のない日付は一覧に含めず、0 枚として補うこともありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有记录的月份": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Months with records"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "記録のある月"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只列出本机有记录的月份；没有列出的月份表示本机当月没有保存记录，不代表 Bing 当时没有发布图片。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only months with local records are listed. An absent month means this Mac saved no records that month; it does not mean Bing published no image."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この Mac に記録がある月だけを表示します。表示されない月は、この Mac がその月に記録を保存していないという意味であり、Bing が画像を公開しなかったという意味ではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开这一月的日期记录": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open this month's dated records"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この月の日付記録を開く"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "月份按每张图片最早的本地记录归组，不是收藏操作的时间。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Months are grouped by each image's earliest local record, not by when it was favorited."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "月は各画像の最初のローカル記録でまとめており、お気に入りにした時刻ではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最早记录月份": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Earliest recorded month"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最初の記録月"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 张收藏没有本机日期记录，已列在末尾；不会为它们编造日期。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld favorites have no local date record and are listed last; no dates are invented for them."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 件のお気に入りにはこの Mac の日付記録がなく、末尾に表示しています。日付を推測して補うことはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出现天数": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appearance days"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出現日数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "收藏数量按图片去重；同一图片在不同地区或日期出现只算一张。这里不推测收藏操作的时间。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Favorites are counted by image; the same image in different regions or on different dates counts once. Favorite action times are not inferred."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "お気に入りは画像単位で数えます。同じ画像が別の地域や日付に現れても 1 件です。お気に入りにした時刻は推測しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机没有这张图片的日期记录。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No local date record for this image."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この画像の日付記録はこの Mac にありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld / %lld 天有记录": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld / %lld days with records"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld / %lld 日分の記録あり"
